# Keep the BE build context small. bin/obj are rebuilt by `dotnet restore`/`publish` inside the
# image; *.user are IDE files; TestResults is test output. The Api.Tests project is left in the
# context (the Dockerfile only restores/publishes src/Api), but its build output is excluded.
**/bin
**/obj
**/*.user
**/TestResults
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
